spice
* SPICE netlist for the given schematic

* Voltage Sources
VCC 2 0 DC 30V
VAC 6 0 AC 100uV

* Resistors
RB 4 2 1MEG
RC 2 3 5K
RL 3 0 100K

* Capacitors
C1 4 0 <capacitance_value> ; specify capacitance value
C2 3 6 <capacitance_value> ; specify capacitance value

* BJT Transistor (Assumed NPN)
Q1 3 4 5 NPN

* Model for NPN transistor
.model NPN NPN (IS=1E-14 BF=100)

.end